; variants-examples.pgn
; Variant PGN examples for testing Jocly / Fairy-Stockfish.
; Sources are indicated in the Site/Source comments.
;
; IMPORTANT:
; - Grand Chess: complete real tournament game.
; - Capablanca Chess: published real "fool's mate" example.
; - Kyoto Shogi and Xiangqi: representative legal notation examples,
;   because the web sources found here expose the variant/game records
;   but not their complete move text in indexed form. They are marked
;   Result "*" and should NOT be treated as historical games.

